#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0083 expect=violation domain=ADSL
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
#note "Positive control. Subject 01-701-1015 has TRTSDT (21915) different from TR01SDT (22281) and must report; 01-701-1023 agrees on both and must not. NOTE this fixture was green BOTH before and after the value_is_reference fix, but before the fix it was green for the WRONG reason - the rule fired on every record regardless of the data, so row 2 would have reported too had it not been added here as the discriminator. The -valid- twin is what actually pins the defect."
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015
dataset ADSL class=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRTSDT  type=Num
col TR01SDT type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 21915 | 22281
